/* ---------- KINDS OF FAMILY BONDAGE (teaching, her words) ---------- */
L137.bondages = [
  { name: "Poverty", icon: "coin", words: "There are certain families going through the bondage of poverty. This is a state where in a family no one succeeds, no matter what you do. No matter how hard you try, nobody makes it on top. You are working, but you are struggling. You cannot build. You cannot buy. Many families have children born into poverty. The devil has blocked their progress so much that whatsoever they do does not prosper; they are always in debt." },
  { name: "Barrenness", icon: "seed", words: "Some families go through a lack of fruitfulness. This is when a family has plenty of barrenness. Some families do not have children; they cannot have it. This is not the will of God for any family, beloved. And we pray and fast today that you will not remain like this — that the Lord God will deliver you by the power of the Holy Ghost.", refs: ["2 Timothy 4:18"], note: "Spoken in the recording as “Second Timothy chapter four, verse seventeen.” The words quoted (“the Lord shall deliver me…unto his heavenly kingdom”) are 2 Timothy 4:18." },
  { name: "Sin and idols in the family", icon: "idol", words: "There are some families that continue to worship idols, and these things continue to fight your life, to fight your progress. These entities are released in the family to cause chaos. They are released in the blood. That is why the blood of Jesus is the new covenant — it is the new blood that will run through your veins. In some families, only you are praying. Some of them are even laughing at you praying. Some of the people in the family even oppose this kind of teaching. Such a family is heading for destruction unless serious deliverance prayer is given. You have believed. You have come to the light — for your children, for your generation, for your household." },
  { name: "Stagnation", icon: "stop", words: "There are some families with the bondage of stagnation. Everybody is stagnant. This is when the progress of a family comes to a full stop, and no one is making progress anymore. Some families bless their children, buy them a house, buy them a car, place them in a job, so that the children will not struggle. But some are struggling because of their nativity. Every serpent spirit biting on your breakthrough, let it be destroyed. Let abundance replace every lack, every insufficiency, every sorrow in your life. The garment of Pharaoh that is upon your life from your family, let it be removed. Every taskmaster in your family assigned against you to halt your life, let them be destroyed, let them be ashamed." },
  { name: "Evil patterns", icon: "repeat", words: "In some families there are bondages of evil patterns. An evil pattern is a cancerous evil in the family from one generation to the other. When you go to a doctor and you have diabetes, what are the first things the doctor will ask you? Is someone in your family? Did your grandparents have diabetes? Even the doctors have to look at your foundation to discover where this is coming from. When people are dying early, it becomes a pattern in the family. What your great-great-grandfather suffered, your grandfather suffered it, your father suffered it, and now you are already seeing the signs in your life. You must rebuke it. You must reject it in prayer and fasting today. You must refuse to remain like this." },
  { name: "Ancestral curses", icon: "scroll", words: "Some of the struggles we are going through are the bondage of ancestral curses. There is a curse you don't know where it's coming from. That is when the sin of your ancestors brings it upon your family. A lot of families are suffering from what they know nothing about. That is why you need to ask questions, find out about your background, and know why you are going through it. Some of our grandparents have kept some secrets. They don't want to mention it because they discovered that what they did at that time was darkness. Your father was in prison at this age. Your grandfather was in prison at that age. You are also now facing the law. Only deliverance. You must refuse to remain like this.", refs: ["Colossians 2:14-15"] },
  { name: "Addictions", icon: "chain", words: "There are so many families struggling with addictions — addiction to alcohol, addiction with cigarettes, addiction with drugs. They have done everything. They cannot stop. What does the devil want to do with that? To destroy life, to bring premature death, to cause sickness, affliction, diseases. Some of these addictions are caused by the background you are coming from. Everybody in the house smokes. Some of your children do not get addicted to drugs for nothing. It is in the foundation. Some of them do not start stealing for nothing. It is in the foundation. We need to pray and fast." },
  { name: "Failure", icon: "down", words: "Some families suffer the bondage of failure. This failure is always behind everything you do, and this is not the will of God. The promise says we shall be the head and not the tail, above only and not beneath. Failure almost at the end of breakthrough. Beloved, we are fasting today. You cannot remain like this.", refs: ["Deuteronomy 28:13"] },
  { name: "Disappointments", icon: "broken", words: "Some of us, because of the family we are connected to, are going through disappointments. You are disappointed in marriage. You are disappointed in finances. In your careers, you are disappointed. Disappointment follows you everywhere you go — broken promises, broken friendships, broken relationships, broken careers. The ambitions fail. This affliction is caused by what is in the background. You must pray." },
  { name: "Slavery", icon: "rise", words: "Some families are going through slavery — when the devil has reduced your entire family members to servants. Whatever you do, you are serving people. When you and your family are seen as the least in all things, when people treat you like rugs in society. You must rise and reject that status by the power of the Holy Ghost. You are not meant to be a slave. You are meant to rise by the power of the Holy Ghost. All these forms of bondage are used by the devil to hold your families in perpetual bondage. But today you are going to take your deliverance by force.", refs: ["Zephaniah 3:19"], note: "Spoken in the recording as “Zachariah, that day…” The words quoted (“I will undo all that afflict thee”) are Zephaniah 3:19." },
  { name: "Household wickedness and vowing powers", icon: "house", words: "In some families there is no love and unity. One person can control the destinies of people in the family. Lots of your struggles are not coming from outside. They are coming from within. God has chosen you to pray — to fight against the strongmen in the family, to fight against the household powers in the family that will not allow you to have your rest. You have to fight against those vowing powers that say no day for this family to progress, no day for this family to be in good health, because I have a covenant with this family. These covenants cause you to stagnate, cause suffering, cause backwardness. It causes you to rise and fall. But the Bible says, He disappointeth the devices of the crafty. Until you resist the devil, he will never flee from your family. Your family deliverance is a gateway of freedom.", refs: ["Job 5:12", "James 4:7"] }
];

/* ---------- REPEAT-AFTER-ME DECLARATIONS ----------
   t = Pastor Kiki's original wording (as spoken).
   f = FAMILY version template. {N} is replaced with the names typed in the boxes.
       The family version is a personalized adaptation and is labeled as such. */
L137.declarations = [
  // theme
  { g: "theme", t: "I refuse to remain like this. In the name of Jesus, I refuse to remain like this.",
    f: "In the name of Jesus, I refuse to let {N} remain like this." },
  { g: "theme", t: "In Jesus' name, I refuse to remain like this. In Jesus' name, it cannot be like this. These attacks must stop.",
    f: "In Jesus' name, {N} will not remain like this. In Jesus' name, it cannot be like this. These attacks against {N} must stop." },
  // navel
  { g: "navel", t: "I receive it in the name of Jesus. I cut my spiritual [umbilical] cord in Jesus' name.",
    f: "In the name of Jesus, I cut every spiritual [umbilical] cord connecting {N} to evil in the foundation.",
    note: "The recording reads “spiritual anchor cord”; Pastor Kiki was teaching on the umbilical cord." },
  // live
  { g: "live", t: "I cannot remain like this. Lord, deliver me in the name of Jesus. All these things I'm going through, Father — I cannot remain like this.",
    f: "Lord, deliver {N} in the name of Jesus. All these things {N} are going through, Father — they cannot remain like this." },
  { g: "live", t: "In the name of Jesus, Lord, I cannot remain like this. Lord, save me!",
    f: "In the name of Jesus, Lord, {N} cannot remain like this. Lord, save {N}!" },
  { g: "live", t: "By the power of the Holy Ghost, I speak Ezekiel chapter sixteen, verse one to six. You saw me struggling in my blood, and You commanded me to live. Lord, I will live. I will live in my progress, in my testimony, in my success. I will live, Lord. I will live.",
    f: "By the power of the Holy Ghost, I speak Ezekiel chapter sixteen, verse one to six over {N}. Lord, You saw {N} struggling in the blood, and You commanded: Live. {N} will live — in progress, in testimony, in success.", ref: "Ezekiel 16:6" },
  { g: "live", t: "Lord, I must live. Master, I must live. In Jesus' name, Amen.",
    f: "Lord, {N} must live. Master, {N} must live. In Jesus' name, Amen." },
  // covenant
  { g: "covenant", t: "Yes, Lord, build my destiny.",
    f: "Yes, Lord, build the destiny of {N}." },
  // communion
  { g: "communion", t: "By the power of the Holy Ghost. By the new covenant of God. In the blood of Jesus. Amen.",
    f: "By the power of the Holy Ghost, by the new covenant of God, in the blood of Jesus, I cover {N}. Amen." },
  { g: "communion", t: "[Every thing] the enemy has put on my destiny — by the blood of Jesus, jump up and die, in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "Every thing the enemy has put on the destiny of {N} — by the blood of Jesus, jump up and die, in the name of Jesus.",
    note: "The opening words of this line were not clear in the recording." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Every [serpent] in my blood, connected to my foundation — as I drink the blood of Jesus, come out of me and die. I drink the blood of Jesus. As I drink the blood of Jesus, come out and die in Jesus' name.",
    f: "Every [serpent] in the blood of {N}, connected to the foundation — by the blood of Jesus, come out and die in Jesus' name.",
    note: "The recording reads “every servant”; Pastor Kiki had been praying against the serpent." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Every power of darkness [unclear] — as I drink the blood of Jesus, come out and die in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "Every power of darkness working against {N} — by the blood of Jesus, come out and die in the name of Jesus." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Every cord of iniquity blocking my communication with God — as I drink the blood of Jesus, I cut you off now. I cut you off now in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "Every cord of iniquity blocking the communication of {N} with God — by the blood of Jesus, I cut you off now in the name of Jesus." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Every power stealing [my] personality, speaking to my prayers in order to report them to the demonic world — by the blood of Jesus, I scatter you in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "Every power stealing the personality of {N}, reporting the prayers of {N} to the demonic world — by the blood of Jesus, I scatter you in the name of Jesus." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Every authority of darkness — by the power of the Holy Ghost and Jesus, I destroy your authorities over my life. I destroy your authorities over my life.",
    f: "Every authority of darkness — by the power of the Holy Ghost and Jesus, I destroy your authorities over the life of {N}." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Father, expose and destroy the records of iniquity in my life. Father, let the mystery and secrets of my fulfillment be made [known] to me.",
    f: "Father, expose and destroy the records of iniquity in the life of {N}. Father, let the mystery and secrets of the fulfillment of {N} be made known." },
  { g: "communion", t: "As I drink the blood of Jesus, I disconnect myself. I disconnect myself from every bloodline curse, by the power of the Holy Ghost.",
    f: "By the blood of Jesus, I disconnect {N} from every bloodline curse, by the power of the Holy Ghost." },
  { g: "communion", t: "The heavens fight for me today. By the blood of Jesus.",
    f: "The heavens fight for {N} today. By the blood of Jesus." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Any principalities, any powers, rulers of darkness, unto my spirit man — causing afflictions, causing poverty, causing destructions in my life — I command you by the blood of Jesus to come out of my life. To come out of my life.",
    f: "Any principalities, any powers, rulers of darkness against {N} — causing afflictions, causing poverty, causing destructions — I command you by the blood of Jesus to come out of the life of {N}." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Any power against the will of God in my life — come out, in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "Any power against the will of God in the life of {N} — come out, in the name of Jesus." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Lord, deliver me and my family. Deliver me and my children. Deliver me and my household.",
    f: "Lord, deliver {N}. Deliver {N} and their children. Deliver {N} and their household." },
  { g: "communion", t: "I need the blood of Jesus. As I drink the blood of Jesus, let there be blood transfusion in my veins. The blood in my veins speaks better things in my life. Speaks better things in my heart.",
    f: "Let the blood of Jesus speak better things over {N} — in their life and in their heart.", ref: "Hebrews 12:24" },
  { g: "communion", t: "By the blood of Jesus, I command strength in my body. I command peace in my life. I command and I destroy every poverty in my life. Anything that is connected to my foundation, I destroy [it from] the whole of my life, in the mighty name of Jesus, as I drink the blood of Jesus.",
    f: "By the blood of Jesus, I command strength in the body of {N}. I command peace in the life of {N}. I destroy every poverty in the life of {N}, and anything connected to the foundation, in the mighty name of Jesus." },
  { g: "communion", t: "As I drink the blood, any connection in my umbilical cord connected to my foundation — I drink this blood to disconnect myself. I cut off my umbilical cord, and that means I am disconnected.",
    f: "By the blood of Jesus, any connection in the umbilical cord of {N} to the foundation — I cut it off. {N} are disconnected." },
  { g: "communion", t: "By the blood of the Lamb. By the blood of Jesus Christ. Wash me with the blood. Cleanse me with the blood.",
    f: "By the blood of the Lamb, by the blood of Jesus Christ — wash {N} with the blood. Cleanse {N} with the blood." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Every strange attack, let there be deliverance. Lord, renew my covenant with You. The new covenant speaks for me — for me and my family, my children, my grandchildren — in the mighty name of Jesus.",
    f: "Every strange attack against {N}, let there be deliverance. The new covenant speaks for {N} — their children and their grandchildren — in the mighty name of Jesus." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Jesus, be a covering in our lives. Be our protection. Cover me. Free us, Lord. Free us.",
    f: "Jesus, be a covering over {N}. Be their protection. Cover {N}. Free {N}, Lord." },
  { g: "communion", t: "Enter into a covenant with me, Lord, as I drink the blood of Jesus.",
    f: "Lord, let {N} come into Your covenant by the blood of Jesus.", ref: "Ezekiel 16:8" },
  { g: "communion", t: "I am coming out of every captivity in the name of Jesus. I am coming out of the affliction, every sickness. I am coming out by the power of the Holy Ghost. My family is coming out. My bloodline is coming out. We are coming out in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "{N} are coming out of every captivity in the name of Jesus — out of the affliction, out of every sickness — by the power of the Holy Ghost. We are coming out in the name of Jesus." },
  // remain
  { g: "remain", t: "Heavenly Father, I will not remain like this.",
    f: "Heavenly Father, {N} will not remain like this." },
  { g: "remain", t: "Father, give me breakthrough. I cannot remain like this. I cannot remain like this. In the name of Jesus.",
    f: "Father, give {N} breakthrough. {N} cannot remain like this. In the name of Jesus." },
  // fire (open prayer time)
  { g: "fire", t: "In the mighty name of Jesus, I reject the spirit of impossibility. I reject the spirit of doubt. I break every evil [hold] from my father's house, from my mother's house — in my life, in my destiny, in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "In the mighty name of Jesus, I reject the spirit of impossibility and doubt over {N}. I break every evil hold from the father's house and the mother's house over {N}, in the name of Jesus.",
    note: "The recording reads “every evil hope.”" },
  { g: "fire", t: "Cleanse me right now. Cleanse us, Lord. Cleanse me and my family and my bloodline. Cleanse us, Lord, in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "Cleanse {N} right now, Lord. Cleanse {N} and our bloodline, in the name of Jesus." },
  { g: "fire", t: "Any power that says I will not go forward, in the name of Jesus, break by fire. I release myself, by the blood of the Lamb, in Jesus' name.",
    f: "Any power that says {N} will not go forward, in the name of Jesus, break by fire. I release {N} by the blood of the Lamb, in Jesus' name." },
  { g: "fire", t: "By the authority and the power of the Lord that I have right now, in the name of Jesus, I shall not remain like this. I disconnect myself. I disconnect myself, by the fire of the Holy Ghost, in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "By the authority of the Lord, in the name of Jesus, {N} shall not remain like this. I disconnect {N} by the fire of the Holy Ghost, in the name of Jesus." },
  { g: "fire", t: "Those fighting my career, my finances, my home, my children, my relationships, my family — die by fire. Fall down and die right now, in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "Those fighting the career, finances, home, children, relationships and family of {N} — die by fire, in the name of Jesus." },
  { g: "fire", t: "Every ancestral [power] — from my mother's side of the family, from my father's side of the family — die by fire, in the name of Jesus.",
    f: "Every ancestral power against {N} — from the mother's side of the family, from the father's side of the family — die by fire, in the name of Jesus." },
  { g: "fire", t: "Arise, arise for us, Lord! Arise for me and my family! Arise for me and my bloodline! Arise for my lineage! Arise for us, Lord!",
    f: "Arise, Lord, for {N}! Arise for our bloodline! Arise for our lineage!" },
  // earth — written prophetic direction (L137 WhatsApp platform)
  { g: "earth", t: "As I stand upon this earth and pour this anointing oil, I declare in the mighty name of Jesus Christ\nO earth, you shall not cooperate with any evil assignment against my life.",
    f: "As I stand upon this earth and pour this anointing oil, I declare in the mighty name of Jesus Christ\nO earth, you shall not cooperate with any evil assignment against {N}." },
  { g: "earth", t: "Every wicked covenant speaking against my family, be broken by the blood of Jesus!",
    f: "Every wicked covenant speaking against {N}, be broken by the blood of Jesus!" },
  { g: "earth", t: "Every evil declaration made against my destiny, be silenced in Jesus Name",
    f: "Every evil declaration made against the destiny of {N}, be silenced in Jesus Name" },
  { g: "earth", t: "Every power fighting my progress, marriage, children, finances, ministry, and divine settlement, lose your hold in Jesus mighty Name!",
    f: "Every power fighting the progress, marriage, children, finances, ministry, and divine settlement of {N}, lose your hold in Jesus mighty Name!" },
  { g: "earth", t: "EARTH! EARTH!! EARTH!!! Hear the Word of the Lord, Every evil declaration spoken against my destiny, be cancelled by the blood of Jesus!",
    f: "EARTH! EARTH!! EARTH!!! Hear the Word of the Lord, Every evil declaration spoken against the destiny of {N}, be cancelled by the blood of Jesus!" },
  { g: "earth", t: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord, Every wicked agreement made against my progress, be broken in Jesus mighty Name.",
    f: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord, Every wicked agreement made against the progress of {N}, be broken in Jesus mighty Name." },
  { g: "earth", t: "Earth, earth, earth! Whatever has been buried to represent my destiny for evil, let every evil assignment against me be destroyed by the fire of the Holy Ghost.",
    f: "Earth, earth, earth! Whatever has been buried to represent the destiny of {N} for evil, let every evil assignment against {N} be destroyed by the fire of the Holy Ghost." },
  { g: "earth", t: "O earth, refuse to cooperate with any wicked plan against my life, my children, and my household.",
    f: "O earth, refuse to cooperate with any wicked plan against the life of {N}, their children, and their household." },
  { g: "earth", t: "Every voice crying against my destiny, let the blood of Jesus speak mercy, victory, and redemption over my life.",
    f: "Every voice crying against the destiny of {N}, let the blood of Jesus speak mercy, victory, and redemption over {N}." },
  { g: "earth", t: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord, I shall not die before my time, I shall live to declare the works of the Lord.",
    f: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord, {N} shall not die before their time, {N} shall live to declare the works of the Lord." },
  { g: "earth", t: "Every evil altar speaking against my family, be silenced by the authority of Jesus Christ",
    f: "Every evil altar speaking against {N}, be silenced by the authority of Jesus Christ" },
  { g: "earth", t: "Earth, earth, earth! Every blessing that God has appointed for my life, let it manifest according to His perfect will",
    f: "Earth, earth, earth! Every blessing that God has appointed for {N}, let it manifest according to His perfect will" },
  { g: "earth", t: "As I pour the anointing oil on the earth Every power assigned to frustrate the works of my hands, lose your influence over my life, in Jesus Name",
    f: "As I pour the anointing oil on the earth Every power assigned to frustrate the works of the hands of {N}, lose your influence over {N}, in Jesus Name" },
  { g: "earth", t: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord! My children shall fulfil their God given destinies",
    f: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord! {N} shall fulfil their God given destinies" },
  { g: "earth", t: "Every generational pattern of failure, disappointment, and stagnation, I declare that it shall not determine my future",
    f: "Every generational pattern of failure, disappointment, and stagnation, I declare that it shall not determine the future of {N}" },
  { g: "earth", t: "By the blood of Jesus, I renounce every evil covenant and declare my allegiance to Jesus Christ alone.",
    f: "By the blood of Jesus, I renounce every evil covenant over {N}, and I commit {N} to Jesus Christ alone." },
  { g: "earth", t: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord! Wherever my name has been mentioned for evil, let the counsel of the Lord prevail",
    f: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord! Wherever the name of {N} has been mentioned for evil, let the counsel of the Lord prevail" },
  { g: "earth", t: "Every door of opportunity that God has ordained for me, open in the mighty name of Jesus",
    f: "Every door of opportunity that God has ordained for {N}, open in the mighty name of Jesus" },
  { g: "earth", t: "Earth, earth, earth! I declare that my marriage, finances, ministry, health, and family are under the lordship of Jesus Christ.",
    f: "Earth, earth, earth! I declare that the marriage, finances, ministry, health, and family of {N} are under the lordship of Jesus Christ." },
  { g: "earth", t: "Every evil word spoken against my advancement, be rendered powerless in Jesus Name.",
    f: "Every evil word spoken against the advancement of {N}, be rendered powerless in Jesus Name." },
  { g: "earth", t: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord! I reject shame, disgrace, and repeated disappointment. Let God's mercy speak for me now.",
    f: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord! I reject shame, disgrace, and repeated disappointment over {N}. Let God's mercy speak for {N} now." },
  { g: "earth", t: "Every wicked plan designed to bury my glory and silence my testimony, be overturned by the power of God.",
    f: "Every wicked plan designed to bury the glory of {N} and silence their testimony, be overturned by the power of God." },
  { g: "earth", t: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord! My family shall experience divine restoration, peace, protection, and breakthrough",
    f: "O earth, hear the Word of the Lord! {N} shall experience divine restoration, peace, protection, and breakthrough" },
  { g: "earth", t: "EARTH! EARTH!! EARTH HEAR THE WORD OF THE LORD! I shall not remain in bondage! My destiny shall not be wasted! My children shall not be destroyed! I shall arise, advance, and fulfil the purpose of God for my life, in the mighty Name of Jesus Christ Amen 🙏🏽",
    f: "EARTH! EARTH!! EARTH HEAR THE WORD OF THE LORD! {N} shall not remain in bondage! The destiny of {N} shall not be wasted! The children of {N} shall not be destroyed! {N} shall arise, advance, and fulfil the purpose of God, in the mighty Name of Jesus Christ Amen 🙏🏽" },
  // thanks
  { g: "thanks", t: "As I place my seed on the altar of God, Father, deliver me and my family, my children. You saw me struggling in my [blood], and You commanded me to [live].",
    f: "Father, deliver {N}. You saw {N} struggling in the blood, and You commanded: Live.",
    note: "The recording reads “struggling in my ground” and “commanded me to lift.”" },
  { g: "thanks", t: "My struggles are over. I'm not going to remain like this, because after all the struggle, He met me and He delivered me.",
    f: "The struggles of {N} are over. {N} will not remain like this, because after all the struggle, the Lord met {N} and delivered {N}." },
  // salvation
  { g: "salvation", t: "Lord Jesus, I repent of my sins and surrender my life. Wash me clean.", f: null },
  { g: "salvation", t: "I believe that Jesus Christ is the Son of God, that He died on the cross for my sins, and rose again on the third day for my victory.", f: null },
  { g: "salvation", t: "I believe that in my heart and make confession with my mouth that Jesus is my Savior and Lord. I receive eternal life in Jesus' name. Amen.", f: null }
];

/* ---------- PASTOR KIKI'S PRAYERS OVER THE PEOPLE (names removed) ---------- */
L137.prayersOver = [
  "I pray for you this morning, wherever you are, in the mighty name of Jesus, that the power of God penetrates your spirit right now, penetrates your soul right now, penetrates your body right now. Wherever you stand, the blood of Jesus we bring upon you now.",
  "The Lord anoint you to recover the wasted years of your life. If you are falling behind in any area of your life, the Lord empower you right now. The Lord recover all your lost opportunities, your wasted years. Any power that says you will not go forward, let those powers be arrested right now, in the name of Jesus. Any power that wants to keep you in want in the midst of plenty, we command those powers to die by fire.",
  "The Lord anoints you with the power of the Holy Ghost to destroy all that is not of the covenant. The Lord arise in your family. The Lord arise right now to bless your inheritance in Christ. All your stolen virtues, we return to you right now.",
  "Every spiritual force connected to your family background, resurfacing from your foundation, swallowing your virtues, swallowing your glory, swallowing your finances, swallowing your marriage, swallowing your joy, your happiness — let the serpent die right now.",
  "The Lord commands you to live — live in your progress, live in your finances, live in your joy, live in your happiness. Live in your peace. Living your dreams, living your marriage. The Lord commands you to live right now, by the power of the Holy Ghost.",
  "By the blood of Jesus, the Lord vindicates you — vindicates your position in the city, in the country, in the nation. Every strange attack against your personality, that tries to crush your personality, that attacks your glory, in the name of Jesus, we destroy them.",
  "The children are your heart's desire. When they attack the children, they want to worry you. The attack is aimed at you. Any attack that is coming on the children to worry you, we rebuke it now. We soak you in the blood and we mark you as a Passover to every attack from the wicked connected to your background, in the mighty name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth."
];
